    "details": {
      "build": "character",
      "level": 1,
      "template": "clone",
      "creatureType": "humanoid",
      "blurb": "Cloning Scout: Superior Clones",
      "biography": "<p><em>Superior Clones (Cloning Scout, 3rd level).</em> When you summon a clone, you can summon a Bunshin instead, using this stat block. Up to 4 at once (6 at 10th, 8 at 17th); while you have Bunshins, you can't have clones from Clone jutsu. A Bunshin lasts 1 minute in combat or 1 hour outside it, can be up to 1 mile from you, and is dispelled if it enters combat in any other way. When one is dispelled, you learn what it knew.</p><p><strong>Armor Class</strong> your Ninjutsu save DC · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 1 · <strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft.</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR, DEX, CON, INT, WIS, CHA: no modifier; saves +0. <strong>Skills</strong> uses its summoner's skills. <strong>Senses</strong> uses its summoner's senses.</p><p><strong>Commands</strong> (yours): Where I say (once per turn, no action: all Bunshin move), Clone Strike (in place of an attack of your Attack action: a Bunshin Strike or Bunshins Cast), Split Focus (once per turn, Bonus action: a skill-based action or the Help action for an ally).</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> its level, AC, attack bonuses, save DCs, skills and senses are set from yours.</p>",
      "summonRole": "Bunshin"
    },
