      "name": "Limited Casting I",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The Bunshin can cast 1 jutsu from its caster's known list, after which it is dispelled. This increases to 2 at 10th and 3 at 17th level. Bunshins can only make one attack with a jutsu per casting, regardless of the number of attacks a jutsu asks for, and they can maintain concentration on jutsu they cast until the beginning of your next turn, after which they lose concentration.</p>",
